					<![CDATA[
						 <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Actually...</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">I&nbsp;got&nbsp;all&nbsp;the&nbsp;names&nbsp;by&nbsp;sticking&nbsp;specific&nbsp;words&nbsp;in&nbsp;a&nbsp;letter&nbsp;scrambler&nbsp;and&nbsp;keeping&nbsp;the&nbsp;parts&nbsp;that&nbsp;sounded&nbsp;cool.</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>The closest English translation there is for &quot;Atanti&quot; is a rough combination of the words &quot;guide&quot; &quot;guardian&quot; and &quot;wanderer&quot;.</p> </div> </div> </div> 
				 	]]>
